 Dendro reaction teams; an ally must collect the leaf."}],"a":[{"names":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"text":"Maximizes Hyperbloom damage.","stats":"EM / EM / EM; prioritize level 90"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Large EM bonus for Hyperbloom.","stats":"EM / EM / EM; pair farming with Deepwood"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Skill maintains team ATK buff.","stats":"HP% / HP% / Healing Bonus; support-only"}],"t":[{"name":"Dendro Rainstorm","members":["Kuki Shinobu","Nahida","Xingqiu","Yelan"],"text":"Nahida and double Hydro generate Dendro Cores; Kuki triggers Hyperbloom and heals. Keep Deepwood on Nahida.","roles":["Hyperbloom / Heal","Dendro / Deepwood","Hydro Applicator","Hydro Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Scholar Hyperbloom","members":["Kuki Shinobu","Alhaitham","Nahida","Xingqiu"],"text":"Alhaitham drives Dendro damage; Xingqiu makes cores and Kuki triggers them while healing.","roles":["Hyperbloom / Heal","On-field Dendro","Dendro / Deepwood","Hydro Applicator"]},{"name":"Budget Bloom Circuit","members":["Kuki Shinobu","Traveler (Dendro)","Xingqiu","Collei"],"text":"Accessible Hyperbloom core: Dendro Traveler and Collei enable cores, Xingqiu supplies Hydro and Kuki detonates them.","roles":["Hyperbloom / Heal","Dendro Applicator","Hydro Applicator","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Coffee Needed","members":["Kuki Shinobu","Keqing","Fischl","Nahida"],"text":"Kuki sustains Quicken and heals while Keqing and Fischl deal Aggravate damage; switch to Tenacity support stats.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","On-field Electro","Electro Sub DPS","Dendro / Deepwood"]}],"v":"Gilded Hyperbloom: 4pc Gilded Dreams offers high EM and efficient farming alongside Deepwood Memories.\nAggravate Support: 4pc Tenacity, HP%/HP%/Healing Bonus; buff Electro carries and maintain strong healing.\nTeam Energy: Favonius Sword helps energy-hungry teammates; build enough CRIT Rate for an on-field proc.\nBudget Hyperbloom: Iron Sting or Dark Iron Sword with triple EM; prioritize character 